+# legacy_decay.dem — Story 6.3's named golden — the DECAYED half of the
+# decayed-vs-modernized throughput pair (stories-v2 6.3: "Golden: T1 of
+# decayed vs modernized throughput"). The advance_fire shape: era 2, the
+# modernization gate ON, all-standard pipes (era 2's newest tier — no pipe
+# is legacy in era 2, so the gate passes when the milestone window elapses
+# and era 2->3 fires at tick 600 = 30000ms). The 6.3 decay then ENGAGES: era
+# 3's newest unlocked tier is wide, so the standard pipes are LEGACY — they
+# serve at the era-3 catalog factor (legacy_decay_permille 500: 15 -> 7 u/s)
+# from the fire on. The era-3 demand (email res->res + streaming
+# content_host->res — the host is fixture node 2, uplinked via pipe 1)
+# floods the decayed network and sheds: T1 pins the decayed throughput, the
+# 60000ms capture shows the era-3 traffic fighting through legacy pipes.
+# The twin (legacy_modernized.dem) runs the IDENTICAL seed/topology/demand
+# with a modernize at the fire — the T1 contrast between the two IS the
+# measurability contract ("watch legacy pipes decay; modernize or suffocate").
+seed 20261
+run 70000ms
+era 2
+fixture qos
+advance gate on
+at 0ms draw 0 1 standard
+at 0ms draw 1 2 standard
+at 0ms draw 3 1 standard
+at 0ms draw 4 1 standard
+capture at 15000ms
+capture at 60000ms
diff --git a/demos/legacy_modernized.dem b/demos/legacy_modernized.dem
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..d7d4781
--- /dev/null
+++ b/demos/legacy_modernized.dem
@@ -0,0 +1,27 @@
+# legacy_modernized.dem — Story 6.3's named golden — the MODERNIZED half of
+# the decayed-vs-modernized throughput pair. Identical to legacy_decay.dem
+# (same seed, topology, demand, gate): era 2 all-standard, the gate fires
+# era 2->3 at tick 600 = 30000ms — and the player MODERNIZES right at the
+# fire: the four standard pipes tier up to wide (Cmd_Set_Pipe_Tier — the
+# story's modernize command, a LOGGED command so the tier flips replay-
+# deterministically from the blessed log) at 30000ms -> apply tick 601. The
+# era-3 demand then flows through the MODERN pipes at full rate (40 u/s):
+# no legacy state, no decay, no shed. The T1 contrast with legacy_decay.dem
+# (same ticks, same demand, only the legacy state differs) is the story's
+# measurability golden; the 60000ms capture shows the era-3 traffic sailing
+# through the modernized backbone.
+seed 20261
+run 70000ms
+era 2
+fixture qos
+advance gate on
+at 0ms draw 0 1 standard
+at 0ms draw 1 2 standard
+at 0ms draw 3 1 standard
+at 0ms draw 4 1 standard
+at 30000ms modernize 0 wide
+at 30000ms modernize 1 wide
+at 30000ms modernize 2 wide
+at 30000ms modernize 3 wide
+capture at 15000ms
+capture at 60000ms
